    {
      "id": "evSzZ3uXgGpdOcqG2BMco",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 695,
      "y": 269.5,
      "width": 907.83935546875,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2121462514,
      "version": 726,
      "versionNonce": 814203762,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787641975574,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Clarify Requirements:\n    - Process flow = select Items -> pay -> Dispense -> Collect -> remaining change (optional)\n    - PaymentTpyes = coins , notes, digital Payments\n    - Restocking items by admin\n    - Display available items with price and quanitity\n    - User selects any item by item_code\n    - dispatch item if suffienct money given and if exceeds return change\n    - Concurrency controls\n\n2. Entities:\n    - VendingMachineSystem: main instance of managing system\n    - Inventory : list of items, stock track\n    - Item: product info, price\n    - States : Idle, ItemSelected, HasMoney, Dispensing\n\n3. Class Design:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Clarify Requirements:\n    - Process flow = select Items -> pay -> Dispense -> Collect -> remaining change (optional)\n    - PaymentTpyes = coins , notes, digital Payments\n    - Restocking items by admin\n    - Display available items with price and quanitity\n    - User selects any item by item_code\n    - dispatch item if suffienct money given and if exceeds return change\n    - Concurrency controls\n\n2. Entities:\n    - VendingMachineSystem: main instance of managing system\n    - Inventory : list of items, stock track\n    - Item: product info, price\n    - States : Idle, ItemSelected, HasMoney, Dispensing\n\n3. Class Design:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
